findings.recommendation:
Switch to argv-array execFileSync to avoid shell parsing entirely:
```ts
import { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';
execFileSync('icacls', [path, '/inheritance:r', '/grant:r', `${user}:F`], { stdio: 'ignore', shell: false });
```
argv-array form passes arguments directly to the OS without involving cmd.exe, so embedded quotes are passed literally to icacls (which handles them itself). Alternatively, validate `path` rejects characters in `["<>|&]` before shelling out.
